== Trivia ==
Apparently, this toilet can spawn [[Hoverboard Toilet|Hoverboard Toilets]], making it the third toilet to spawn other [[enemies]]. The others being the [[Dual Cargo Toilets]] and the [[Carrier Astro Toilet]]. Coincidently, all three of them are bosses.
